## Summary

Update the `done` command to emit a WorkCompleted event with the jj change-id when completing a bug.

## Implementation

In `src/commands/status/done.rs`:

```rust
pub fn done(bug_id: &str) -> Result<()> {
    let store = Store::open()?;

    // 1. Get current change-id (the one being completed)
    let change_id = jj::current_change_id()?;

    // 2. Record WorkCompleted event
    let event = Event::work_completed(bug_id, &change_id);
    store.append_event(&event)?;

    // 3. Update status to Done (existing logic)
    // ...

    Ok(())
}
```

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] WorkCompleted event emitted when done
- [ ] Change-id captured from current change
- [ ] Event written to state branch
- [ ] docket show displays completed change-id
- [ ] Existing done command behavior preserved

